# Lower-level manual ACP attach for Plugins/AI/Live Host only.
# Default Plugins/AI stories stay Fake even when both values are set.
# Prefer `pnpm ai:smoke:storybook`, which seeds and supervises both processes.
# 1. In another terminal: pnpm ai-host serve --workspace ./tmp/agent-workspace
# 2. Copy the printed token into LAPIS_AGENT_RUNTIME_TOKEN
# 3. Restart Storybook and open Plugins/AI/Live Host. Do not add a sidecar.

# LAPIS_AGENT_RUNTIME_URL=ws://127.0.0.1:7345
# LAPIS_AGENT_RUNTIME_TOKEN=
